data: {"type":"agent_chunk","agent":"critic","content":"- **Missing PAM requirement:** The targeting bullet omits the protospacer adjacent motif, which Cas9 needs next to the target site. Without it, the \"locates matching DNA\" claim is incomplete.\n- **Single-source claims:** The repair-template claim for replacing disease mutations rests only on the second citation, with no mention of off-target risks or efficiency limits.\n- **Overstated SWAPnDROP scope:** The third bullet relies on one citation and one species (*E. coli*). It doesn't note whether the method works across other bacteria."}

